flowchart TB
    User[User: terminal or headless task]
    Settings[INI settings and CLI arguments]
    Rules[System prompt and project AGENTS.md]

    subgraph Harness["Pieni harness"]
        Loop[Agent: conversation and model/tool loop]
        Adapter[Provider: request and reply adapters]
        Dispatch[Toolbox: validate and dispatch]
        Policy[Permissions: path checks and DCG]
        Tools[read / write / edit / bash]
        Compact[Prepare history and request a summary]
        History[Store: active messages and historical logs]
    end

    SDK[openai or openrouter SDK]
    Model[Remote API or local model server]
    OS[Local files and subprocesses: current user's access]
    DB[(.pieni/pieni.db)]

    User --> Loop
    Settings --> Adapter
    Settings --> Policy
    Rules --> Loop
    Loop --> Adapter
    Adapter --> SDK
    SDK --> Model
    Model --> SDK
    SDK --> Adapter
    Adapter --> Loop
    Loop --> Dispatch
    Dispatch --> Policy
    Policy -->|allowed| Tools
    Policy -->|denied result| Loop
    Tools --> OS
    OS -->|result or error| Tools
    Tools -->|tool result| Loop
    Loop <--> History
    History <--> DB
    Loop --> Compact
    Compact --> Adapter
